      "window_s": 5.204000000000008,
      "used_s": 5.2,
      "explorer": false,
      "quality": "Fast",
      "vo_land": "Those were elements nobody had found yet. Over the next thirty-odd years, every one of them was found in nature or made in a lab."
    },
    {
