      "window_s": 5.2039999999999935,
      "used_s": 5.2,
      "explorer": false,
      "quality": "Quality",
      "vo_land": "The charge in the nucleus decides how many electrons an atom holds, and the outer electrons decide how it behaves."
    },
    {
