      "window_t1": 124.889,
      "window_s": 5.2039999999999935,
      "used_s": 5.2,
      "explorer": false,
      "quality": "Fast",
      "vo_land": "Many scientists believe he would have won a Nobel Prize."
    },
    {
      "id": "25_atom_recap",
      "file": "25_atom_recap_v01.mp4",
      "sha256": "49f0c51cc69cc52ae91fff852964f80fc2565cd214e0024189146554bd91cc8f",
      "window_t0": 124.889,
      "window_t1": 130.093,
      "window_s": 5.2039999999999935,
      "used_s": 5.2,
      "explorer": false,
      "quality": "Fast",
      "vo_land": "So this is what's really inside an atom. First it was an idea. Then Dalton gave each kind a weight. Thomson found a piece inside it. Rutherford found its tiny centre. And Moseley counted it."
    },
    {
      "id": "26_explorer_count_table",
      "file": "26_explorer_count_table_v01.mp4",
      "sha256": "b81a1103ad170ce20710ce50df799a333af2eb23adf0417ce9ffc09ad3879601",
